  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ObjParser is a specialized service responsible for ingesting raw Wavefront .obj file content and transforming it into a structured, WebGL-ready MeshData object. It parses geometric primitives like vertices (v), texture coordinates (vt), and normals (vn), while also handling face definitions (f) and triangulating N-gons. The core logic consolidates geometry by de-duplicating vertices based on the unique combination of position, UV, and normal indices before outputting the final indexed buffers."
  },
